        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Chloroacetic acid, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Chloroacetic acid, at plant
Production of monochloroacetic acid (MCA) from the reaction of acetic acid with chlorine.;
CAS number: 000079-11-8; 
Formula: C2H3ClO2; 
UUID: e5b0821c-048e-3e4c-b68d-9a694798715a
All precursors and transports, as well as infrastructure.
Location: RER
Technology: based on literature data and plant data in Europe and North America
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: see technology 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e5b0821c-048e-3e4c-b68d-9a694798715a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
